  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening LAF service members&apos; &quot;ecosystem&quot;- sustainable development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the livelihoods and wellbeing of service members in the Lebanese Armed Forces (LAF) and their families. The project is supporting LAF personnel affected by the surge in violence, promoting the wellbeing of service members and their families, reducing negative coping mechanisms and ultimately fostering their capabilities.

Main activities: 
Supporting the livelihoods and wellbeing of service members and their families
1. Bolstering offering, affordability and accessibility of LAF commissaries
2. Ensuring access to education to vulnerable children of LAF families</narrative>
  </description>
